OL,4,CMan dies in M42 crash near Birmingham  
OL,5,CAirport                                
OL,6,GA man died in a serious crash on the   
OL,7,GM42 near Birmingham Airport, police    
OL,8,Gsaid.                                  
OL,10,FThe crash, involving a van and a       
OL,11,Florry, happened on the northbound      
OL,12,Fcarriageway of the motorway between    
OL,13,Fjunction 5a and junction six on        
OL,14,FSaturday, just after 12:30 GMT.        
OL,16,FThe van driver, a man in his 40s, died 
OL,17,Fat the scene, West Midlands Police     
OL,18,Fsaid.                                  
OL,20,FThe carriageway remained closed for    
OL,21,Fseveral hours but was fully reopened   
OL,22,Fto traffic earlier on Sunday morniG1/4 
